TRACT8 — a program card for the Music Thing Modular Workshop System Computer
Copyright (c) 2026 Andy Jenkinson (uglifruit)

This card is an original implementation of the 1939 Bell Labs Voder, after
Homer Dudley. The Voder itself is long out of any patent and no code from it
survives; the debt is conceptual.

It vendors, unmodified and under their own terms:

